der. Luckily, it didn\u2019t really matter in this situation.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-13","r":3.0,"t":"It\u2019s smells really nice but leaked out in shipment.","x":"The smell is very nice, but the bottle leaked in shipment. I suggest changing how it\u2019s shipped. Everything else that came in the box now also smells like baby powder. Luckily, it didn\u2019t really matter in this situation.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-14","r":3.0,"t":"It\u2019s smells really nice but leaked out in shipment.","x":"The smell is very nice, but the bottle leaked in shipment. I suggest changing how it\u2019s shipped. Everything else that came in the box now also smells like baby powder. Luckily, it didn\u2019t really matter in this situation.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-15","r":1.0,"t":"Eh","x":"The little thing will choke you... a little goes a small way. I have a strong scent of smell and wanted something light.... TOTALLY OPPOSITE! But it does smell like baby powder just very strong baby powder","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-16","r":5.0,"t":"love it","x":"Bought it once before when looking for something baby powder scented based on reviews. 2nd time purchasing now and will continue. Roll on and small bottle perfect for car, purse , travel.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-17","r":5.0,"t":"How good and soft it smells","x":"I just love this perfume. It\u2019s so soft and gentle. I wear it every day for work and get so many compliments on how good it smells even from the men. They always tell me I smell so nice.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-18","r":5.0,"t":"The smell is fantastic","x":"It smells like baby powder, and the fragrance lasts.  I washed my teeshirt,  got it out of the dryer, and still smelled it a little bit.  I love it and will order more.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-19","r":5.0,"t":"Perfectly Powdery","x":"It is perfect! Exactly what I hoped for. Not overpowering and scent lasts. I\u2019ve had bad reactions to perfumes in the past. In love with this!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2020"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-20","r":5.0,"t":"Awesome roll on","x":"This product literally smells just like baby powder! It smells amazing! A little goes a long way too & lasts all day! I couldn\u2019t be happier!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-21","r":1.0,"t":"It's a no for me","x":"This scent is just too much for an adult woman.  The scent is like you're trying too hard to smell like baby powder. It's just too much.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-22","r":5.0,"t":"Smells amazing","x":"I love it. Perfume irritates me but this doesn\u2019t bother me at all. Plus, I smell like a baby all day! Worth the purchase.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-23","r":5.0,"t":"Smells terrific and works","x":"This is amazing and smells terrific like a baby would. \ud83e\udd70 I love the scent and wear it on my neck every day now.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2020"},{"id":"B07467LHZ7-24","r":5.0,"t":"Smells great and last all day","x":"Smells great and the scent lasts all day. I even worked out and was sweaty and still smelled like baby powder","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the scent for smelling exactly like baby powder.","cites":[1,2,4,6,10,11]},{"text":"Many reviewers note the scent is long-lasting and that a small amount goes a long way.","cites":[3,4,6,9,10]},{"text":"Several reviewers report the bottle leaked or arrived damaged during shipment.","cites":[7,13,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers appreciate that the product is gentle and suitable for sensitive skin or settings where strong scents aren't allowed.","cites":[2,3,10]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention the product is natural and cruelty free.","cites":[4]}]},"qa":[]}